Subject: [PATCH 34/36] The detailer pass shows every knob it will have, all of
 them refused

Padding, mask blur, its own denoise and its own prompt were in the model and
not on the screen. An expert who has used ADetailer looks for exactly those
four, and a pass card that shows two of them reads as a different feature.
---
 .../components/PassChainEditor.tsx            | 75 ++++++++++++++-----
 src/locales/en.ts                             |  2 +
 src/locales/es.ts                             |  2 +
 3 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/engines/image-studio/components/PassChainEditor.tsx b/src/engines/image-studio/components/PassChainEditor.tsx
